		(descr "J110 service port: HRO TYPE-C-31-D-06 (LCSC C2689964), USB Type-C receptacle, USB 2.0, 16 signal contacts, vertical (top-entry) SMD, body 8.94 x 3.16 mm, 6.40 mm tall. Recommended PCB layout (top view) of the HRO drawing TYPE-C-31-D-06 rev A, 2020-11-02: two rows of 0.30 x 0.87 mm pads on 0.50 mm pitch, 0.43-1.30 mm from the centre line, A row north; four shell legs on 4.80 x 4.30 mm with 1.35 x 1.10 mm pads and 0.85 x 0.60 mm slots; a 0.52 mm round peg hole west and a 0.72 x 0.52 mm slotted one east, 7.50 mm apart. Positions +/-0.05 mm to datum A. The drawing recommends a 0.8 +/-0.1 mm board; the shell legs are 0.95 mm long.")
